load @term/seed/code/algebra/boolean
  find boolean-algebra

# A logical connective: an operator that builds a compound proposition from simpler ones, and, or, not, implies, if-and-
# only-if. The connectives are the operations of a Boolean algebra (classical) or a Heyting algebra (constructive), and
# they are how the surface checker combines decidable conditions. The form carries the Boolean algebra the connectives
# operate in.
form connective
  link algebra, like boolean-algebra
